{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Hidden Inventory\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-06\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The jujutsu sorcerers, Utahime Iori and Mei Mei, are dispatched to an ominous manor where several people have gone missing. They infiltrate the manor and attempt to destroy the cursed spirit's barrier, but suddenly the building starts to crumble.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9000784/screencap/64a424d8a45e7.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"懐玉\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Inventory 2\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-13\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Gojo and Geto are assigned to the mission of escorting and erasing the young girl compatible with the Tengen - the Star Plasma Vessel. Amanai Riko is being targeted by the Curse User Group Q, and the religious cult the Star Religious Group.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816818/screencap/64ae6f358799e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"懐玉-弐-\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Inventory 3\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-20\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Gojo and Geto beat back the curse users after the bounty placed on Amanai's head when her cell phone rings. A captured Kuroi is displayed on her phone. Gojo tries to bring Amanai back to Jujutsu High, but she insists on going to the negotiations herself.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816819/screencap/64b7bf5f8b1e4.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"懐玉-参-\"},{\"title\":\"Hidden Inventory 4\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-27\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"\\\"Let's go home, Riko-chan.\\\" The moment Geto extends a hand to Amanai, the worst that could possibly happen does. Geto is left dumbstruck as Toji Fushiguro makes his appearance. Toji then declares that he killed Satoru Gojo.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816820/screencap/64c1165c72ee0.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"懐玉-肆-\"},{\"title\":\"Premature Death\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-03\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"August 2007. Gojo starts to handle missions on his own, causing Geto to, as well. One day a certain individual appears before Geto. What's the conclusion that led to Gojo becoming the strongest jujutsu sorcerer, and Geto becoming the most evil curse user?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816821/screencap/64ca37f2d0eea.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"玉折\"},{\"title\":\"That`s How It Is\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-31\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"2018. After finishing a mission one day, Itadori decides to go to the movies, Kugisaki decides to go shopping, and Fushiguro tells them he's going home. After parting ways Kugisaki is approached by a woman who suddenly asks if she was with Itadori-kun.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816823/screencap/64ef3b339eb77.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"そういうこと\"},{\"title\":\"Evening Festival\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-07\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between Muta and Mahito continues and reaches its conclusion. Later, on October 31st, a veil is lowered over Shibuya and various jujutsu sorcerer teams assemble around the area.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816825/screencap/64f879917b4d1.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"宵祭り\"},{\"title\":\"The Shibuya Incident\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-14\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Team Mei Mei are reassigned to a veil that has been lowered over Meiji Shrine Station. The team splits up and Yuji encounters a grasshopper curse assigned to protecting the veil. Elsewhere Satoru Gojo encounters Jogo, Hanami, and Choso.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816826/screencap/6501d4a485175.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"渋谷事変\"},{\"title\":\"Shibuya Incident - Gate, Open\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-21\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The battle between Satoru Gojo, Jogo, Hanami and Choso begins. Gojo informs Hanami that they will die first. Yuji encounters a woman who tells him that everyone was turned into monsters and boarded a train. As Gojo's battle continues, the train arrives.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816827/screencap/6512e5a2ebcd2.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"渋谷事変 開門\"},{\"title\":\"Pandemonium\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-28\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Now that Satoru Gojo has been sealed, Mechamaru works with Team Mei Mei to inform them about what is going on and has them work on enacting his plan on what to do now.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816828/screencap/65146f5846741.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"昏乱\"},{\"title\":\"Seance\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-05\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Nanami, Fushiguro, and Ino meet up with Itadori, then Nanami issues new orders for the others to work together to lift the veil keeping sorcerers out.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816829/screencap/651d438600dbd.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"降霊\"},{\"title\":\"Dull Knife\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-12\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Yuji and Megumi lift the veil that was keeping sorcerers from entering Shibuya. Nobara and Nitta encounter Shigemo and a battle ensues. Shigemo has the upperhand, but then Nanami arrives with the deaths of the assistant supervisors in mind.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816830/screencap/6526836758d49.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"鈍刀\"},{\"title\":\"Red Scale\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-19\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Yuji makes his way to Shibuya Station where he's confronted by Choso. Choso unleashes his Convergence and the battle between him and Yuji commences.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9816831/screencap/652ffb20ed7f6.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"赫鱗\"},{\"title\":\"Fluctuations\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-26\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Mei Mei and Ui Ui fight the Special-Grade Disease Curse summoned by whatever is pretending to be Suguru Geto. Meanwhile, Nanami joins up with Maki and Naobito, but they encounter a cursed spirit with unknown powers.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879034/screencap/6538e5e7f3dc3.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"揺蕩\"},{\"title\":\"Fluctuations, Part 2\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-02\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Nanami, Maki, and Naobito are driven to the edge after the Special-Grade Cursed Spirit, Dagon, activates his Domain Expansion, Horizon of the Captivating Skandha. Fushiguro gives them a glimpse of a way to escape death, then Toji intrudes upon the fight.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879035/screencap/6542601e76278.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"揺蕩-弐-\"},{\"title\":\"Thunderclap\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-09\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Sukuna refuses to heed Jogo's advice after waking up, instead displaying his overwhelming strength against the Special-Grade Cursed Spirit, Jogo. Meanwhile, Fushiguro faces off against the rampant Toji with neither being aware of the other's identity.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879036/screencap/654b52f0cb505.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"霹靂\"},{\"title\":\"Thunderclap, Part 2\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-16\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"After being severely injured in his fight against Toji, Fushiguro suffers a surprise attack from Shigemo. On the verge of death, Fushiguro desperately heads toward Dougenzaka crossing and summons a certain Shikigami with his Ten Shadows Technique.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879037/screencap/655dd976d7a7e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"霹靂-弐-\"},{\"title\":\"Right and Wrong\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-23\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Itadori reawakens with grievous resolve as he bears witness to the aftermath Sukuna has wrought upon Shibuya. Meanwhile, Nanami continues to fight through packs of transfigured humans in an exhausted haze until Mahito appears before him.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879038/screencap/6560a65d897fa.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"理非\"},{\"title\":\"Right and Wrong, Part 2\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-30\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Itadori launches into a back-and-forth battle against Mahito, but he struggles against Mahito's ploy of using average people against him. Meanwhile, Kugisaki encounters one of Mahito's separated bodies as she returns to the battlefield.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879039/screencap/6569a9e1e6f83.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"理非-弐-\"},{\"title\":\"Right and Wrong, Part 3\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-07\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Itadori stands in a daze at the disaster before his eyes, his mind already well past its limit. As a curse, Mahito is elated at seeing his ideal sequence of events play out before him, and he prepares to further finish off Itadori.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879040/screencap/657082c6d320d.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"理非-参-\"},{\"title\":\"Metamorphosis\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-14\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"After rescuing Itadori from his predicament, Todo bolsters his morale and encourages him to stand back up. As Mahito kicks things into higher gear, he begins using Soul Multiplicity and Body Repel to unleash omnidirectional attacks.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879041/screencap/6579c8b8bef8b.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"変身\"},{\"title\":\"Metamorphosis, Part 2\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-21\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The moment it appeared Itadori and Mahito's battle to the death was resolved, the being wearing Geto's body asked, \\\"Shall I save you, Mahito?\\\" Itadori immediately recognizes the man before him as the very same one who sealed away Gojo and leaps to attack.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879042/screencap/6582e339e546e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"変身-弐-\"},{\"title\":\"Shibuya Incident - Gate, Close\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-28\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Choso begins to realize the identity of the mastermind parasitizing Geto's corpse as sorcerers gather for the final moments of the Shibuya Incident. The special-grade sorcerer, Yuki Tsukumo, comes to the rescue when they're on the verge of death.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9879043/screencap/658c1174b40c2.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"渋谷事変 閉門\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}